js-yaml — https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml (4.3.2)

The YAML reader and writer in crates/hoh-loader follow js-yaml's JSON schema:
the rules that resolve plain scalars to null, booleans and numbers
(lib/type/null.js, bool.js, int.js, float.js) and the quoting rules of the
dumper (lib/dumper.js) are translated from its source.

